title: Shelf3A
---
<<declare $r1_dinner_shelf = false>>
// Talk target of Samantha's bookshelf (Hotspots layer). She has a word for him while he
// is in her flat.
<<if (($chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_door and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes) or ($chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_stand)) and not $r1_dinner_shelf>>
    <<set $r1_dinner_shelf to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: Find anything interesting?
    You: "Power and Intimacy: A Reader." Is this for your course?
    {$samantha_name}: Some of it is.
    You: And the rest?
    {$samantha_name}: The rest is for fun. Put it back where you found it.
<<elseif ($chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_door and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes) or ($chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_stand)>>
    {$samantha_name}: It's not going anywhere. Neither is dinner. Sit.
<<else>>
    You: Her bookshelf. Everything in alphabetical order.
<<endif>>
===
